  example:"A 3-year-old girl with spastic quadriplegia and visual impairment in a village near Medak is carried all day. The DEIC team provides a wooden CP chair with tray, a prone stander and a cup with a cut-out rim, teaches backward chaining for removing her frock, and helps the family apply under the ADIP scheme.",
