  viva:[["What is backward chaining?","Teaching a task by having the child complete the last step first, then adding earlier steps."],["Why are standers used in non-walking children?","For weight bearing to support bone density, hip development, ROM and upright participation."],["Name a government scheme for aids in India.","The ADIP scheme (Assistance to Disabled Persons for purchase and fitting of aids and appliances)."]],
